#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up an online lab environment to use Qiskit in the cloud. Choose a "
"preconfigured environment or set up your own."
msgstr ""
"Siapkan lingkungan lab online untuk menggunakan Qiskit di cloud. Pilih "
"lingkungan yang sudah dikonfigurasi atau buat sendiri."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Online lab environments"
msgstr "Lingkungan lab online"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"online-environments\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"online-environments\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Online lab environments {#online-lab-environments}"
msgstr "Lingkungan lab online {#online-lab-environments}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In addition to downloading and installing Qiskit to work on your local "
"machine, there are several options available for those who prefer to work in"
" an online development environment.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selain mengunduh dan menginstal Qiskit untuk bekerja di mesin lokalmu, ada "
"beberapa opsi tersedia bagi yang lebih suka bekerja di lingkungan "
"pengembangan online.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Several providers offer online Jupyter environments with Qiskit preinstalled"
" for fast and convenient onboarding. These recommended providers include the"
" cloud service provider OVHcloud and the quantum software development cloud "
"platform qBraid.\n"
msgstr ""
"Beberapa penyedia menawarkan lingkungan Jupyter online dengan Qiskit yang "
"sudah terinstal untuk onboarding yang cepat dan praktis. Penyedia yang "
"direkomendasikan ini termasuk penyedia layanan cloud OVHcloud dan platform "
"cloud pengembangan perangkat lunak kuantum qBraid.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Recommended notebook environments with Qiskit preinstalled {#recommended-"
"notebook-environments-with-qiskit-preinstalled}"
msgstr ""
"Lingkungan notebook yang direkomendasikan dengan Qiskit sudah terinstal "
"{#recommended-notebook-environments-with-qiskit-preinstalled}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additional online Jupyter notebook environments like IBM Watson&reg; Studio,"
" Google Colab, and Microsoft Azure Machine Learning Studio can be used to "
"work with Qiskit by following the appropriate instructions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lingkungan Jupyter notebook online lainnya seperti IBM Watson&reg; Studio, "
"Google Colab, dan Microsoft Azure Machine Learning Studio bisa digunakan "
"untuk bekerja dengan Qiskit dengan mengikuti instruksi yang sesuai.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "OVHcloud AI notebooks {#ovhcloud-ai-notebooks}"
msgstr "Notebook AI OVHcloud {#ovhcloud-ai-notebooks}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"OVHcloud Public Cloud and OVHcloud Startup users can use their OVHcloud "
"quantum notebooks to access Qiskit and submit jobs to IBM&reg; QPUs with "
"their IBM Quantum&reg; or IBM Cloud&reg; account. To learn more, visit the "
"[OVHcloud Documentation and tutorials](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/world-"
"documentation?id=kb_home) page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengguna OVHcloud Public Cloud dan OVHcloud Startup dapat menggunakan "
"notebook kuantum OVHcloud mereka untuk mengakses Qiskit dan mengirimkan job "
"ke QPU IBM&reg; dengan akun IBM Quantum&reg; atau IBM Cloud&reg; mereka. "
"Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, kunjungi halaman [Dokumentasi dan tutorial "
"OVHcloud](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/world-documentation?id=kb_home).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"OVHcloud AI notebooks are not available in some regions, such as the United States. Additionally, user interfaces might look different in different regions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Notebook AI OVHcloud tidak tersedia di beberapa wilayah, seperti Amerika Serikat. Selain itu, antarmuka pengguna mungkin terlihat berbeda di wilayah yang berbeda.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to get started:\n"
msgstr "Ikuti langkah-langkah berikut untuk memulai:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Create an IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "[Buat akun IBM Cloud.](/guides/cloud-setup)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Set up an OVHcloud account](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-account-"
"create-ovhcloud-account?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0043022).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Siapkan akun OVHcloud.](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-account-create-"
"ovhcloud-account?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0043022)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create an OVH Public Cloud project](https://support.us.ovhcloud.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/360002245784-Creating-Your-First-Public-Cloud-Project).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Buat proyek OVH Public Cloud.](https://support.us.ovhcloud.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/360002245784-Creating-Your-First-Public-Cloud-Project)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow the steps in [Launch your first AI "
"Notebook](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-public-cloud-ai-notebooks-"
"definition?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0048270), selecting "
"**Qiskit** for the framework.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ikuti langkah-langkah di [Luncurkan AI Notebook "
"pertamamu,](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-public-cloud-ai-notebooks-"
"definition?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0048270) pilih **Qiskit** "
"untuk framework-nya.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "qBraid Lab {#qbraid-lab}"
msgstr "qBraid Lab {#qbraid-lab}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit users can use qBraid's preconfigured Python environments by following"
" these instructions. For more information, see the [qBraid "
"Docs](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/introduction).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengguna Qiskit dapat menggunakan lingkungan Python yang sudah dikonfigurasi"
" dari qBraid dengan mengikuti instruksi berikut. Untuk informasi lebih "
"lanjut, lihat [Dokumentasi "
"qBraid.](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/introduction)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up an qBraid free account](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/account).\n"
msgstr "[Buat akun gratis qBraid.](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/account)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create a Lab environment](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/getting-"
"started).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Buat lingkungan Lab.](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/getting-"
"started)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Launch qBraid Lab, click the **ENVS** icon on the right, click **+ ADD** at "
"the top of the new sidebar, and search for Qiskit.  Click the version you "
"want to use, then click **Install**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Luncurkan qBraid Lab, klik ikon **ENVS** di sebelah kanan, klik **+ ADD** di"
" bagian atas sidebar baru, dan cari Qiskit. Klik versi yang ingin kamu "
"gunakan, lalu klik **Install**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create a Jupyter notebook by clicking **Python 3 [Qiskit]** in the Notebook "
"section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Buat Jupyter notebook dengan mengklik **Python 3 [Qiskit]** di bagian "
"Notebook.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can install any additional Python packages (Such as Qiskit v1.2) in a "
"notebook cell by running `%pip install [package_name].` For more "
"information, see the [Pip (magic) "
"commands](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/notebooks#pip-magic-"
"commands) topic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa menginstal paket Python tambahan (seperti Qiskit v1.2) di sel "
"notebook dengan menjalankan `%pip install [package_name].` Untuk informasi "
"lebih lanjut, lihat topik [Perintah Pip "
"(magic)](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/notebooks#pip-magic-"
"commands).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additional notebook environments for Qiskit users {#additional-notebook-"
"environments-for-qiskit-users}"
msgstr ""
"Lingkungan notebook tambahan untuk pengguna Qiskit {#additional-notebook-"
"environments-for-qiskit-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For platforms without Qiskit preconfigured, the setup instructions are "
"similar, except that you must install Qiskit manually. You will create an "
"account, start a new project (or notebook or workspace, depending on the "
"platform), and install Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk platform tanpa Qiskit yang sudah dikonfigurasi, instruksi "
"pengaturannya serupa, kecuali kamu harus menginstal Qiskit secara manual. "
"Kamu akan membuat akun, memulai proyek baru (atau notebook atau workspace, "
"tergantung platformnya), dan menginstal Qiskit.\n"

